{
  "_comment": "কে কী কাজ করবে — এই ফাইলটাই টিমের তালিকা। নতুন এজেন্ট যোগ করতে নিচে একটা ব্লক কপি করে বসান।",
  "settings": {
    "default_agent": "opencode",
    "max_rounds": 3,
    "max_calls_per_run": 8,
    "max_pair_calls": 3,
    "reply_char_limit": 4000
  },
  "agents": [
    {
      "name": "opencode",
      "label": "🧑‍💻 OpenCode",
      "kind": "cli",
      "enabled": true,
      "roles": [
        "worker",
        "chat"
      ],
      "command": [
        "opencode",
        "run",
        "--auto",
        "--model",
        "$OPENCODE_MODEL:-opencode/deepseek-v4.1-flash-free",
        "{message}"
      ],
      "timeout_sec": 900,
      "keywords": [
        "code",
        "fix",
        "bug",
        "refactor",
        "test",
        "implement",
        "কোড",
        "বাগ",
        "ঠিক"
      ],
      "notes": "প্রথমে OpenCode এর ফ্রি মডেল; 'usage limit' এলে OpenRouter দিয়ে আবার (fallback, এখনো যাচাই হয়নি)",
      "fallback_commands": [
        [
          "opencode",
          "run",
          "--auto",
          "--model",
          "$OPENCODE_FALLBACK_MODEL:-openrouter/openrouter/free",
          "{message}"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "cline",
      "label": "🟦 Cline",
      "kind": "cli",
      "enabled": false,
      "roles": [
        "worker",
        "chat"
      ],
      "command": [
        "cline",
        "-P",
        "openrouter",
        "-y",
        "{message}"
      ],
      "timeout_sec": 900,
      "keywords": [
        "ui",
        "frontend",
        "design",
        "review",
        "plan",
        "রিভিউ",
        "ডিজাইন"
      ],
      "notes": "⚠️ বন্ধ: OpenRouter ফ্রি টিয়ারে Cline ২,৮৩,১১৫ টোকেন চায়, afford করে ৩৩,৩২৩ — 'requires more credits'। আপাতত OpenCode (fallback সহ) ও Claude Code যথেষ্ট",
      "env": {
        "OPENROUTER_API_KEY": "$OPENROUTER_API_KEY"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "claude",
      "label": "🟠 Claude Code",
      "kind": "cli",
      "enabled": true,
      "roles": [
        "worker",
        "chat"
      ],
      "command": [
        "claude",
        "-p",
        "{message}",
        "--output-format",
        "text"
      ],
      "timeout_sec": 900,
      "env": {
        "ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL": "https://openrouter.ai/api",
        "ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN": "$OPENROUTER_API_KEY",
        "ANTHROPIC_API_KEY": "",
        "ANTHROPIC_MODEL": "$CLAUDE_MODEL:-openrouter/free"
      },
      "keys": [
        "OPENROUTER_API_KEY"
      ],
      "keywords": [
        "architecture",
        "hard",
        "refactor",
        "গুরুত্বপূর্ণ",
        "আর্কিটেকচার"
      ],
      "notes": "যাচাই করা: `-p` কাজ করে, বাংলায় উত্তর দেয়। খালি উত্তর এলে fallback হিসেবে নির্দিষ্ট ফ্রি মডেল চেষ্টা করে",
      "fallback_commands": [
        [
          "claude",
          "-p",
          "{message}",
          "--output-format",
          "text",
          "--model",
          "minimax/minimax-m3:free"
        ],
        [
          "claude",
          "-p",
          "{message}",
          "--output-format",
          "text",
          "--model",
          "nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b:free"
        ],
        [
          "claude",
          "-p",
          "{message}",
          "--output-format",
          "text",
          "--model",
          "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "hermes",
      "label": "☤ Hermes",
      "kind": "cli",
      "enabled": true,
      "roles": [
        "worker",
        "chat",
        "memory"
      ],
      "command": [
        "hermes",
        "chat",
        "-q",
        "{message}",
        "-m",
        "openrouter/free",
        "--provider",
        "openrouter",
        "-Q",
        "--yolo",
        "--max-turns",
        "3"
      ],
      "timeout_sec": 600,
      "keys": [
        "OPENROUTER_API_KEY"
      ],
      "keywords": [
        "remember",
        "memory",
        "notes",
        "launch",
        "মনে",
        "পরিকল্পনা"
      ],
      "notes": "ফ্রি মডেল চেইন: openrouter/free → minimax/minimax-m3:free → nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b:free → qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free (OpenRouter এ ফ্রি তালিকা বদলায়, তাই একাধিক ধাপ)",
      "fallback_commands": [
        [
          "hermes",
          "chat",
          "-q",
          "{message}",
          "-m",
          "minimax/minimax-m3:free",
          "--provider",
          "openrouter",
          "-Q",
          "--yolo",
          "--max-turns",
          "3"
        ],
        [
          "hermes",
          "chat",
          "-q",
          "{message}",
          "-m",
          "nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b:free",
          "--provider",
          "openrouter",
          "-Q",
          "--yolo",
          "--max-turns",
          "3"
        ],
        [
          "hermes",
          "chat",
          "-q",
          "{message}",
          "-m",
          "qwen/qwen3.8-27b:free",
          "--provider",
          "openrouter",
          "-Q",
          "--yolo",
          "--max-turns",
          "3"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "openhands",
      "label": "🖐️ OpenHands",
      "kind": "github_issue",
      "enabled": false,
      "roles": [
        "worker",
        "cloud"
      ],
      "mention": "@openhands",
      "keywords": [
        "issue",
        "pr",
        "big",
        "long",
        "বড়"
      ],
      "notes": "⏸️ এখনো বন্ধ — ওদের GitHub App বসালেই চালু হবে। ধাপ: docs/openhands-setup-bn.md (৫ মিনিট)"
    }
  ]
}
